  "description": {
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Eragrostis minor",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eragrostis_minor",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 1376359787,
      "text": "Eragrostis minor, the little lovegrass or smaller stinkgrass, is a widespread species of flowering plant in the family Poaceae, native to most of the subtropical and warm temperate Old World, and introduced to North America, South America, and Australia. Preferring disturbed open places with little competition, and sandy or gravelly soils, it is often found growing on rail embankments, road verges, cracks in sidewalks, and waste areas. Its seeds are edible, but quite small and difficult to harvest and handle, so it is usually regarded as a famine food."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Eragrostis minor",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eragrostis_minor",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 207976991,
      "text": "Eragrostis minor, la petite éragrostide ou l'Eragrostis faux-pâturin, est une espèce de plantes monocotylédones de la famille des Poaceae, originaire du bassin méditerranéen, devenue subcosmopolite."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Eragrostis minor",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eragrostis_minor",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 40537950,
      "text": "Eragrostis minor é uma espécie de planta com flor pertencente à família Poaceae."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Eragrostis minor",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eragrostis_minor",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 29430992,
      "text": "Eragrostis minor, atau yang dikenal sebagai little lovegrass atau smaller stinkgrass, adalah spesies tumbuhan berbunga yang tersebar luas dalam famili Poaceae. Tumbuhan ini asli dari sebagian besar wilayah Dunia Lama yang beriklim subtropis dan hangat, serta telah diperkenalkan ke Amerika Utara, Amerika Selatan, dan Australia. Tumbuhan ini menyukai tempat terbuka yang terganggu dengan kompetisi rendah serta tanah berpasir atau berbatu, dan sering ditemukan tumbuh di tanggul kereta api, tepi jalan, celah trotoar, dan area terbengkalai. Bijinya dapat dimakan, namun cukup kecil dan sulit untuk dipanen serta diolah, sehingga biasanya dianggap sebagai pangan darurat."
    }
  },
